aps or door access or fight head on and aggressively utilizing heavy weapons and explosives to purge the infestation at its root. The Dross respond to your tactics and react accordingly.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083940/extras/0514c285a6f5c7ffa2556511a16e5509.webp?t=1783638137\" width=605 height=24 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083940/extras/a722a4714eefe7e6258f2eb16cec29c0.poster.avif?t=1783638137\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083940/extras/a722a4714eefe7e6258f2eb16cec29c0.webm?t=1783638137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083940/extras/a722a4714eefe7e6258f2eb16cec29c0.mp4?t=1783638137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pistols, rifles, shotguns, heavy weapons, and explosives complement your arsenal against the Dross. Upgrade your suit, weapons, and tools to help you fight the way you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083940/extras/12450eda4f0e53971992156a9053002e.webp?t=1783638137\" width=604 height=24 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083940/extras/e7fbf767645733812cb8d503dc5d46a2.poster.avif?t=1783638137\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083940/extras/e7fbf767645733812cb8d503dc5d46a2.webm?t=1783638137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:/